assignment.experiment:
Different refinement targets. Keep only what every recipe shares and that is saturated: bottom box [0.014,-0.016,-0.0081,0.029,0.016,-0.0066] 0.0016 r0.007 and f7 0.0035 r0.006. Replace the universal upper box [0.01,-0.028,-0.003,0.027,0.012,0.0081] with three targets no run used together:
(1) f5 bore-face group 0.0032 r0.004 (upper bore wall);
(2) +y lobe box [0.014,0.013,-0.0081,0.027,0.026,0.001] 0.0034 r0.004 over f38/f8/f43/f44;
(3) -y wall box [0.012,-0.03,-0.004,0.028,-0.012,0.0081] 0.0042 r0.004 over f9.
All at h 0.008, order 2. Price first:
- if nodes >6000, raise f5 to 0.0036;
- if min_quality <0.1, raise the radii to 0.005.
Solve 2 removes only the f5 group. Solve 3 is the x0.75 reference.

